{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47131","headline":"赠秀才 · 虚中","name":"赠秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筠阳多胜致，夫子纵游遨。\n凤鸟瑞不见，鲈鱼价转高。\n门开沙觜静，船系树根牢。\n谁解伊人趣，村沽对郁陶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虚中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}